## L0 — "any index below 131072 is progress"

**Killed** r0, 2026-08-20. **Seat** measure-eos.

Indices `131065..131071` all score exactly 12800, identical to the shipped baseline,
because the minimal legal score is `ceil` of a centibit quantity. The first index that
moves the score at all is **131064**.

**Re-open condition.** None. It is arithmetic, decided exactly by `verify/ladder.mjs`.
